config APP_DIS
	bool "Device Information Service serial number"
	default y
	depends on BT_DIS_SETTINGS && SETTINGS_RUNTIME
	help
	  Program the DIS Serial Number characteristic (0x2A25) from the
	  device's Bluetooth identity address at boot, so each tag reports a
	  unique serial that matches the address a scanner shows.

	  The service itself comes from Zephyr (CONFIG_BT_DIS, configured in
	  prj.conf) and registers statically at boot; this module only fills in
	  the one value that cannot be known at build time.
